<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord to load 28 Aug cargoes - trade. [CORRECTED 12:15 GMT]</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord to load 28 Aug cargoes - trade. [CORRECTED 12:15 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is scheduled to load 28 standard cargoes of 855,000 barrels each in August, unchanged from the 28 cargoes in the revised July programme, traders said. (Corrects July cargo tally).</p>
<p>The August tally included two cargoes delayed from the original July programme, traders said.</p>
<p>A two-week stoppage at the Statfjord B platform is scheduled to start on August 9, operators Statoil say, which will hit this month's output.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8060</p>
</text>
